  <content>
    <procedure>
      <preliminaryRqmts>
        <reqCondGroup>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要有足够的可操作空间满足泵的拆装；还需备有专门拆装泵的平台。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要具备力矩扳手、千分表、塞尺。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场备有零部件及工具等的储存设施。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要有相应的运输工具及起吊行车，包括具备各种安装、操作资质的专业人员。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要具备清洁剂、润滑剂。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
        </reqCondGroup>
        <reqSupportEquips>
          <supportEquipDescrGroup>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>手动拉拔器</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>QB/T5537（规格CSQ-300）</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>勾扳手</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>JB/ZQ4624/(A110-115)</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>扳手</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>M16、M20</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
          </supportEquipDescrGroup>
        </reqSupportEquips>
        <reqSupplies>
          <noSupplies>
          </noSupplies>
        </reqSupplies>
        <reqSpares>
          <noSpares>
          </noSpares>
        </reqSpares>
        <reqSafety>
          <safetyRqmts>
            <caution>
              <warningAndCautionPara>端面密封面不允许有径向划痕或损伤；径向密封面不允许有轴向划痕或损伤,密封件密封部位不允许任何划痕或凹凸。</warningAndCautionPara>
              <warningAndCautionPara>检查紧固件无损伤、螺纹表面光滑（清洁干净无毛刺），拧紧时转动平稳。</warningAndCautionPara>
              <warningAndCautionPara>拧紧时力矩必须分3）拧紧到位，拧紧时必须对称拧紧完所有螺母后，才能以更大力矩拧紧螺母。</warningAndCautionPara>
            </caution>
          </safetyRqmts>
        </reqSafety>
      </preliminaryRqmts>
      <mainProcedure>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>组装</title>
          <para>
            <sequentialList>
              <listItem>
                <para>检查确认新的机械密封组件应无可见缺陷。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>通过定位块将机械密封和轴套锁定。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>安装O型圈，将机械密封安装至轴上。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>安装O形圈，回装泵盖，通过机械密封压盖螺柱、螺母及垫圈装入泵盖上，螺栓紧固力矩240N.m。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拧紧泵盖与托架的紧固螺柱、螺母，紧固力矩300N.m。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>安装叶轮键，对准键槽，装入叶轮。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>安装止动垫圈及叶轮螺母，紧固力矩值300~350Nm【待补充】。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>测量叶轮口环与壳体密封环配合处的径向跳动，要求值≤0.1mm，参考图6.10.4.1示意图执行，记录在维修报告5.3中。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>将转子部件装到垫有塑料布的小车上，运到泵安装处。</para>
              </listItem>
            </sequentialList>
          </para>
        </proceduralStep>
      </mainProcedure>
      <closeRqmts>
        <reqCondGroup>
          <noConds>
          </noConds>
        </reqCondGroup>
      </closeRqmts>
    </procedure>
  </content>
